This is the lookup index for cross-project memory. It isn't part of the
start-of-session read: open it when MAP.md routing comes up empty or when you
need reference material. Working agreements live in
[context/feedback/DIGEST.md](context/feedback/DIGEST.md), one line each, so
this index only points there. Project memory is indexed in each
`projects/<slug>/MEMORY.md`.

