name: efficient-astra
description: Coordinate broad Codex tasks with bounded workers and compact evidence while Astra handles consequential decisions. Use for substantial scans, investigations, multi-file implementation, large tool output, or independent review. Skip small edits and tightly coupled debugging where delegation adds overhead.
